[2026-09-11 05:49:01] local.INFO: product seo{"meta_title":"Overhead Plastic Water Storage Tank - 500 to 2000 Litre Water Tank - Skipper Marina Tanks","meta_description":"Browse Skipper Marina water storage tanks in 500, 1000 & 2000 litre capacities - UV-resistant, insulated & food-grade materials. Water Tank available in various colours.","meta_keywords":"Marina Tank","meta_author":"Skipper Pipes","canonical_url":"","robots":"","og_title":"","og_description":"","og_type":"website","twitter_title":"","twitter_description":"","twitter_card":"summary_large_image","custom_schema_json":"{\"@context\":\"https:\/\/schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Are Skipper Marina Tanks safe for drinking water?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes, Skipper Marina Tanks are made from food-grade material and are anti-bacterial and UV-resistant\u2014ensuring complete safety.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What sizes are available for Skipper Marina Tanks?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Skipper Marina Tanks come in a variety of capacities, 2000 LTR, 1500 LTR, 1000 LTR, 750 LTR, and 500 LTR.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can I install water tank on a rooftop?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes, UV-resistant water tanks reinforced with ribs for enhanced strength are ideal for rooftop installation.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Is the Water Tank lid lockable or airtight?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes, Skipper Water Tanks have threaded lid which is airtight and prevents contamination and water loss due to evaporation.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Which water tank brand is best?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"The best water tank brand is one that prioritises hygiene, structural strength, and thermal insulation. Skipper Pipes is highly regarded across India for its advanced manufacturing processes. Our Marina Tanks feature food-grade virgin plastic, a 10-year warranty, and multi-layer structural ribs, making them a top-tier choice for safe tanks for water storage.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Which tank is best for water storage?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"A multi-layer, UV-stabilised plastic water storage tank made from virgin, food-grade material is the best choice for residential use. It prevents chemical leaching into your drinking water. For outdoor or rooftop installations, look for a water storage tank with structural ribs to prevent bulging under pressure, and built-in insulation to keep water temperature controlled.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What is an insulated water tank?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"An insulated water storage tank features a specialised foam layer embedded between its outer and inner plastic walls (such as Skipper's 4-layer Marina Tank). This insulation acts as a thermal barrier, preventing the harsh Indian summer heat from scorching your water supply and keeping it cool and fresh throughout the day.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What is the price of a 500 Litre Water Tank?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"The 500 litre water tank price in India generally varies depending on the specific layer configuration (3-layer vs. 4-layer insulated). Typically, quality consumer plastic tanks range from \u20b96,000 to \u20b98,000.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How much does a 1000 litres tank cost?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"The water tank 1000 ltr price depends heavily on its specific features, such as anti-bacterial coatings and foam insulation layers. On average, a high-quality 1000 litre water tank ranges between \u20b912,000 and \u20b917,000 in the Indian market.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What is the price of 2000 litre Water Tank?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"A heavy-duty 2000 litre water tank price typically ranges between \u20b925,000 and \u20b932,000 depending on the design tier and layer count. Choosing a 2000 litres water tank with a 10-year warranty and a reinforced ribbed design ensures maximum value over time by eliminating replacement costs.\"}}]}","schema_json":"{\"@context\":\"https:\/\/schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Are Skipper Marina Tanks safe for drinking water?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes, Skipper Marina Tanks are made from food-grade material and are anti-bacterial and UV-resistant\u2014ensuring complete safety.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What sizes are available for Skipper Marina Tanks?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Skipper Marina Tanks come in a variety of capacities, 2000 LTR, 1500 LTR, 1000 LTR, 750 LTR, and 500 LTR.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can I install water tank on a rooftop?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes, UV-resistant water tanks reinforced with ribs for enhanced strength are ideal for rooftop installation.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Is the Water Tank lid lockable or airtight?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes, Skipper Water Tanks have threaded lid which is airtight and prevents contamination and water loss due to evaporation.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Which water tank brand is best?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"The best water tank brand is one that prioritises hygiene, structural strength, and thermal insulation. Skipper Pipes is highly regarded across India for its advanced manufacturing processes. Our Marina Tanks feature food-grade virgin plastic, a 10-year warranty, and multi-layer structural ribs, making them a top-tier choice for safe tanks for water storage.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Which tank is best for water storage?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"A multi-layer, UV-stabilised plastic water storage tank made from virgin, food-grade material is the best choice for residential use. It prevents chemical leaching into your drinking water. For outdoor or rooftop installations, look for a water storage tank with structural ribs to prevent bulging under pressure, and built-in insulation to keep water temperature controlled.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What is an insulated water tank?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"An insulated water storage tank features a specialised foam layer embedded between its outer and inner plastic walls (such as Skipper's 4-layer Marina Tank). This insulation acts as a thermal barrier, preventing the harsh Indian summer heat from scorching your water supply and keeping it cool and fresh throughout the day.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What is the price of a 500 Litre Water Tank?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"The 500 litre water tank price in India generally varies depending on the specific layer configuration (3-layer vs. 4-layer insulated). Typically, quality consumer plastic tanks range from \u20b96,000 to \u20b98,000.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How much does a 1000 litres tank cost?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"The water tank 1000 ltr price depends heavily on its specific features, such as anti-bacterial coatings and foam insulation layers. On average, a high-quality 1000 litre water tank ranges between \u20b912,000 and \u20b917,000 in the Indian market.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What is the price of 2000 litre Water Tank?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"A heavy-duty 2000 litre water tank price typically ranges between \u20b925,000 and \u20b932,000 depending on the design tier and layer count. Choosing a 2000 litres water tank with a 10-year warranty and a reinforced ribbed design ensures maximum value over time by eliminating replacement costs.\"}}]}"}  
