[2026-09-11 05:51:02] local.INFO: product seo{"meta_title":"Overhead Plastic Water Storage Tank - 500 to 2000 Litre Water Tank - Skipper Marina Tanks","meta_description":"Browse Skipper Marina water storage tanks in 500, 1000 & 2000 litre capacities - UV-resistant, insulated & food-grade materials. Water Tank available in various colours.","meta_keywords":"Marina Tank","meta_author":"Skipper Pipes","canonical_url":"","robots":"","og_title":"","og_description":"","og_type":"website","twitter_title":"","twitter_description":"","twitter_card":"summary_large_image","custom_schema_json":"{\"@context\":\"https:\/\/schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Are Skipper Marina Tanks safe for drinking water?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes, Skipper Marina Tanks are made from food-grade material and are anti-bacterial and UV-resistant\u2014ensuring complete safety.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What sizes are available for Skipper Marina Tanks?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Skipper Marina Tanks come in a variety of capacities, 2000 LTR, 1500 LTR, 1000 LTR, 750 LTR, and 500 LTR.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can I install water tank on a rooftop?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes, UV-resistant water tanks reinforced with ribs for enhanced strength are ideal for rooftop installation.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Is the Water Tank lid lockable or airtight?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes, Skipper Water Tanks have threaded lid which is airtight and prevents contamination and water loss due to evaporation.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Which water tank brand is best?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"The best water tank brand is one that prioritises hygiene, structural strength, and thermal insulation. Skipper Pipes is highly regarded across India for its advanced manufacturing proces