r\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"A multi-layer, UV-stabilised plastic water storage tank made from virgin, food-grade material is the best choice for residential use. It prevents chemical leaching into your drinking water. For outdoor or rooftop installations, look for a water storage tank with structural ribs to prevent bulging under pressure, and built-in insulation to keep water temperature controlled.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What is an insulated water tank?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"An insulated water storage tank features a specialised foam layer embedded between its outer and inner plastic walls (such as Skipper's 4-layer Marina Tank). This insulation acts as a thermal barrier, preventing the harsh Indian summer heat from scorching your water supply and keeping it cool and fresh throughout the day.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What is the price of a 500 Litre Water Tank?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"The 500 litre water tank price in India generally varies depending on the specific layer configuration (3-layer vs. 4-layer insulated). Typically, quality consumer plastic tanks range from \u20b96,000 to \u20b98,000.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How much does a 1000 litres tank cost?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"The water tank 1000 ltr price depends heavily on its specific features, such as anti-bacterial coatings and foam insulation layers. On average, a high-quality 1000 litre water tank ranges between \u20b912,000 and \u20b917,000 in the Indian market.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What is the price of 2000 litre Water Tank?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"A heavy-duty 2000 litre water tank price typically ranges between \u20b925,000 and \u20b932,000 depending on the design tier and layer count. Choosing a 2000 litres water tank with a 10-year warranty and a reinforced ribbed design ensures maximum value over time by eliminating replacement costs.\"}}]}"}  
