:\"A heavy-duty 2000 litre water tank price typically ranges between \u20b925,000 and \u20b932,000 depending on the design tier and layer count. Choosing a 2000 litres water tank with a 10-year warranty and a reinforced ribbed design ensures maximum value over time by eliminating replacement costs.\"}}]}","schema_json":"{\"@context\":\"https:\/\/schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Are Skipper Marina Tanks safe for drinking water?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes, Skipper Marina Tanks are made from food-grade material and are anti-bacterial and UV-resistant\u2014ensuring complete safety.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What sizes are available for Skipper Marina Tanks?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Skipper Marina Tanks come in a variety of capacities, 2000 LTR, 1500 LTR, 1000 LTR, 750 LTR, and 500 LTR.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can I install water tank on a rooftop?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes, UV-resistant water tanks reinforced with ribs for enhanced strength are ideal for rooftop installation.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Is the Water Tank lid lockable or airtight?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes, Skipper Water Tanks have threaded lid which is airtight and prevents contamination and water loss due to evaporation.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Which water tank brand is best?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"The best water tank brand is one that prioritises hygiene, structural strength, and thermal insulation. Skipper Pipes is highly regarded across India for its advanced manufacturing processes. Our Marina Tanks feature food-grade virgin plastic, a 10-year warranty, and multi-layer structural ribs, making them a top-tier choice for safe tanks for water storage.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Which tank is best for water storage?\",\"acceptedAnswe